Test: sequence-no-duplicate-title >> invalid >>> docs/rules/sequence-no-duplicate-title.md incorrect 1
Filename: sequence-no-duplicate-title-incorrect-1.mmd

Code:
  1 | sequenceDiagram
  2 |   title first
  3 |   title second
    |   ^~~~~~~~~~~~ [1]
  4 |   A ->> B: x
  5 |

[1] mermaid.js replaces the earlier title with the one of this `title`.
    Suggestions:
      - Remove this statement.
        Output:
          1 | sequenceDiagram
          2 |   title first
          3 |   A ->> B: x
          4 |
      - Remove the earlier statement that sets the title.
        Output:
          1 | sequenceDiagram
          2 |   title second
          3 |   A ->> B: x
          4 |
---


